    "updated_at": "2016-02-22T17:01:46Z",
    "body": "I have a work in progress for this, but I need some design input. The way this change handles transferable objects is by giving those [[IsDetached]] and [[Transfer]] internal methods. Should I similarly put a [[Clone]] internal method on all objects that is then defined on a per-object basis?\n\nI currently have the cloning still as a giant switch statement similar to what the specification has today. Transferring already had explicit hooks, which I'm simply renaming since structured cloning is ECMAScript business, but cloning didn't. @domenic?\n",
