    "body": "The main problem with adding a [[Clone]] internal method is how we'd define all the extensions to objects defined in the ECMAScript specification. Would something like\n\n```\n<hx>Extensions to the Array object</hx>\n<p>Each Array object must implement the internal method below.</p>\n<hx+1>[[Clone]] ( <var>input</var>, <var>targetRealm</var> )</hx+1>\n<ol>\n <li><p>Let <var>output</var> be a new Array object in <var>targetRealm</var>.</p></li>\n <li><p>Set <var>output</var>.length to <var>input</var>.length.</p></li>\n <li><p>Return ? DeepCloneOwn(<var>input</var>, <var>output</var>).</p></li>\n</ol>\n```\n\nwork?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
