    "updated_at": "2016-02-22T17:34:39Z",
    "body": "(Note that this rewrite does not attempt to define marshalling as some seem to think is a required part of defining structured cloning properly. It merely specifies the realm where cloned objects are to be created and increases the details with which certain operations are defined. It glosses over the fact that the two realms might not be able to reach each other, though I'll try to make it more explicit on that point.)\n",
