    "updated_at": "2016-02-22T17:40:15Z",
    "body": "Since we're not editing ES directly, I'd instead prefer a form that doesn't need monkeypatches. So for example, define each algorithm as an abstract operation ArrayClone(input, targetRealm), in its own subsection of the structured clone algorithm. Then have a table or switch statement mapping conditions to algorithms.\n",
